    "announcementText": "<p>We've consulted our maps and compass and have found a terrific location for a store in Jersey City, NJ. We are proud to be joining the neighborhood, and to continue our commitment to providing nourishment to the surrounding communities through our <a href=\"/content/trjo/us/en/home/neighborhood-shares.html\">Neighborhood Shares</a> program.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nOur Crew is working hard so we can open our doors. We\u2019ll continue to post new details about the store and its opening here, so please check back for updates!<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Date &amp; Time Opening:</b><br>\r\nTBD<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b><a href=\"https://locations.traderjoes.com/nj/jersey-city/874/\">Store Location</a>:</b><br>\r\n55 Hudson St<br>\r\nJersey City, NJ 07302<br>\r\n<br>\r\nWe look forward to seeing you!<br>\r\n</p>\r\n",
