    "pagePath": "/home/recipes/bacon-apple-brie-panini",
    "recipeDescription": "<p><b><a href=\"https://www.traderjoes.com/home/products/pdp/ciabatta-demi-baguette-096399\">Trader Joe\u2019s Ciabatta Demi-Baguette</a></b> combines the best of both bread worlds: <b>Baguette</b>\u2019s classic shape with <b>Ciabatta</b>\u2019s thin crust and light crumb. Its mild flavor makes it an exceptional vehicle for a variety of sandwiches, (we're looking at you, bacon, apple, and brie!) and noteworthily, stands up impressively well to the heat and pressure of a panini press.&nbsp;What\u2019s more, it\u2019s Demi nature&nbsp; is ideal for savoring a solo meal, or sharing with a friend alongside a hearty bowl of chili or soup.</p>\r\n",
