    "pagePath": "/home/recipes/maple-marshmallow-popcorn-bars",
    "recipeDescription": "<p><b><a href=\"https://www.traderjoes.com/home/products/pdp/mini-maple-flavored-marshmallows-076219\">Trader Joe\u2019s Mini Maple Flavored Marshmallows</a></b> melt easily with butter to create a gooey and oh-so-delicious binder for sweet snack bars. For the crucial crunchy component, add slightly crushed <b>TJ\u2019s Movie Theater Popcorn</b> in lieu of the typical cereal to take these bars in a decidedly sweet <i>and</i> salty direction. Festively fall-y and filled with the sweet, caramelly scent of Maple, these bars are a marvelous treat in a lunchbox or on movie night.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n",
