    "pagePath": "/home/recipes/salty-maple-cold-foam",
    "recipeDescription": "<p>A jar of<b> <a href=\"https://www.traderjoes.com/home/products/pdp/organic-maple-butter-078933\">Trader Joe\u2019s Organic Maple&nbsp;Butter</a></b> contains a single ingredient: organic maple syrup, that\u2019s been whipped into a thick, spreadable, and delicious butter-like consistency. It\u2019s fantastic on French toast, marvelous mixed into yogurt, enchanting as an accompaniment to a cheese board, and wonderful whipped into a coffeeshop-like cold foam to top a cup of coffee.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To really fall-ify your morning brew, try adding this cold foam atop an iced coffee using <b><a href=\"https://www.traderjoes.com/home/products/pdp/pumpkin-spice-cold-brew-coffee-concentrate-079207\">TJ\u2019s Pumpkin Spice Flavored Cold Brew Coffee Concentrate</a></b> or a mug of <b><a href=\"https://www.traderjoes.com/home/products/pdp/autumn-maple-coffee-066148\">TJ\u2019s Autumn Maple Coffee</a></b>. <i>Mmmmmaple</i>!</p>\r\n",
